                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Beco's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Accessible sustainable positioning + broad everyday category + bamboo material focus + omnichannel distribution + B2B adjacent segment. Multi-dimensional sustainable advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can smaller sustainable brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific product niching (specific material specialty, regional focus, luxury sustainable positioning). Category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>Is B2B sustainable products real opportunity?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — corporate ESG + hotel + restaurant + institutional sustainability drives meaningful B2B demand. Under-invested segment for many sustainable D2C brands.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest sustainable everyday lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Accessible pricing + broad category + material innovation + omnichannel distribution combined. Not luxury sustainability — accessible sustainable positioning has larger TAM.</p>
